# This folder holds ~65 GB of footage, frames, COLMAP databases and training
# outputs. None of that belongs in git, so everything is ignored by default and
# only code and write-ups are let back in. To track a new top-level file or
# folder, add a "!" line for it below.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/NOTES.md
!/PORTFOLIO.md
!/PLAN_depth_distortion.md
!/requirements.txt

!/scripts/
/scripts/__pycache__/

# Viewer: my code only. The .splat scenes, camera/trajectory JSON and the
# footage in viewer/video are data, and main.js.orig/.preghost are backups.
!/viewer/
/viewer/*
!/viewer/index.html
!/viewer/verify.html
!/viewer/main.js
!/viewer/ghosts.js
!/viewer/convert.py
!/viewer/LICENSE
!/viewer/README.md

# Changes to Brush, kept as a patch because brush/ is its own upstream clone.
!/brush-patch/

# Small metric summaries only. Images, logs and the survey/xdense dumps stay out.
!/reports/
/reports/*
!/reports/*.json
!/reports/*.txt

.DS_Store
*.pyc
# PUBLISH.md is left out on purpose: it describes the home NAS setup.
